1: //! OpenFlightReader Offline Local Web Daemon & Telemetry Dashboard (`flightreader-server`).
2: //!
3: //! Provides a lightweight, 100% offline, air-gapped Axum HTTP and WebSocket daemon
4: //! delivering interactive flight telemetry visualization, synchronized 60 FPS timeline
5: //! scrubbing, virtual aeronautical instruments (ADI, Mode 2 RC sticks, 12-cell battery heatmap),
6: //! and autonomous 2D Canvas trajectory fallback without external cloud dependencies.
